SUMMARY:Pirate Ship Scavenger Hunt @ Southwest Regional
DESCRIPTION:For August's scavenger hunt\, we’ve hidden 10 pictures of 
 pirates & pirate ships throughout the children’s area of the 
 library...Can you find them all?!\n\nThis scavenger hunt will run for the 
 entire month of August. \n\nIf you have any questions\, please contact us @ 
 919-560-8592.
