DESCRIPTION:Join our circle for a lapsit storytime of activities including 
 bouncing rhymes\, baby cuddling\, songs and fingerplays. This is an 
 excellent opportunity to join in a group activity and share a fun 
 experience with other parents/caregivers. Ages Birth-18 Mos.
