SUMMARY:"Unearth a Story" and Color Your Own Dinosaur!
DESCRIPTION:Choose a Dinosaur template to use on your whiteboard\, then 
 decorate it with markers or paint to create your own colorful dinosaur.\n\n 
                                                                   
