SUMMARY:Rethink Your Drink! Hydrate with DINE
DESCRIPTION:It's hot out there! Join us for a closer look at how we hydrate 
 - We will have a demonstration on reading and calculating added sugar on a 
 nutrition facts label\, as well as a sampling of fruit infused water and a 
 seasonal fruit salad! \n\n\n	Identify signs/symptoms of 
 dehydration\n	General hydration tips\n	How to identify the amounts of sugar 
 in popular beverages\n	Discuss the impact on our health with 
 overconsumption of sugar-sweetened beverages\n
