 families in Durham!\n\nProgram details: \n\nDate: Thursdays\n\nTime: 10a.m. 
 \n\nLocation: North Regional Library\n\nAddress: 221 Milton Rd. Durham\, NC 
 27712 \n\nIf you have any questions\, accessibility questions or 
 accommodation needs\, please contact Molly at mschaefer@dconc.gov.  We ask 
