BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20260827T150000Z
DTEND:20260827T160000Z
DTSTAMP:20260827T000000Z
SUMMARY:Beginner Computer Classes at East Regional Library
DESCRIPTION:Join us Thursday mornings for digital skills courses through 
 Northstar Digital Literacy! These self-paced online modules allow users to 
 track progress and earn certificates for completion. A library staff member 
 will also be available for assistance.\n\n \n\nAvailable topics 
 include:\n\n\n	Phone Keyboard Basics & Logging In\n	Basic Computer 
 Skills\n	Internet Basics\n	Using Email\n	Windows 10 & 11\n	Mac 
 OS\n	Microsoft Word\, Excel\, and PowerPoint\n	Google Docs\n	Social 
 Media\n	Information Literacy\n	Career Search Skills\n	Your Digital 
 Footprint\n	Accessing Telehealth Appointments\n	Cybersecurity Basics\n\n\n 
 \n\nLaptops will be provided\, but participants are welcome to use their 
 own computers. Attendees are encouraged to bring headphones.
LOCATION:East Meeting Room\, East Regional Library (211 Lick Creek Lane)
ORGANIZER;CN="Eva Miles":MAILTO:emiles@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Computer Class, Digital/Tech Literacy
UID:LibCal-14288-16803025
URL:https://durhamcountylibrary.libcal.com/event/16803025
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20260827T170000Z
DTEND:20260827T180000Z
DTSTAMP:20260827T000000Z
SUMMARY:Is this AI? Spotting Misinformation Online
DESCRIPTION:It is almost impossible to be online today without encountering 
 content generated by artificial intelligence (AI). Whether you are looking 
 for the latest news\, scrolling through posts on social media\, or looking 
 up a new recipe for dinner\, AI has made it more difficult to tell if what 
 we see online can be trusted. \n\nThis presentation will cover some of the 
 clues we can look for to determine if something has been generated by AI 
 and help you learn skills to verify the information you find online.
LOCATION:Computer Lab\, Main Library (300 N. Roxboro St)
ORGANIZER;CN="James McKinnell":MAILTO:jmckinnell@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Digital/Tech Literacy
UID:LibCal-14288-17209134
URL:https://durhamcountylibrary.libcal.com/event/17209134
END:VEVENT
