 different STEAM topic and further our learning with a hands-on activity or 
 craft.\n\nThis month\, we will learn all about spiders and create our own 
 bouncing spiders using egg cartons\, googly eyes\, pipe cleaners\, rubber 
 bands\, glue\, and scissors!\n\nRegistration is required.\n\nIf you have 
