SUMMARY:What Should I Put in My Lunchbox?
DESCRIPTION:Join this nutrition workshop designed to inspire and educate 
 participants on creating balanced\, nutritious\, and delicious meals for 
 your lunchbox. Learn how to incorporate essential nutrients\, explore a 
 variety of food groups\, and discover creative ideas for meal prep that are 
 both satisfying and health conscious. Whether you're packing lunch for 
 work\, school\, or on-the-go\, this program will equip you with the 
 knowledge and skills needed to make every packed meal something to look 
 forward to.\n\nThis workshop is presented by licensed and registered 
 dietitian Lucy Hayhurst\, founder of Well Balanced Nutrition.\n\n
LOCATION:Meeting Room #4347\, Main Library (300 N. Roxboro St)
ORGANIZER;CN="Austin Daniels":MAILTO:ausdaniels@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Business, Food & Cooking, Health & Fitness
