SUMMARY:(5th Annual) Local Author Showcase
DESCRIPTION:Mingle with local writers as they share their stories\, sign 
 copies of their books\, and showcase their talents. Authors will have the 
 opportunity to read short excerpts from their books and time will be 
 allotted for individual conversations and networking. Whether you're an 
 aspiring writer or a supporter of great literature\, this event is an 
 excellent opportunity to bask in our valuable\, vibrant community. About a 
 dozen authors from the "Triangle" will table at this event. Come join 
 us!\n\n \n\nAuthors: Our tabling list is now full for this event. If you'd 
 like to be put on the waitlist for this or similar events\, please email 
 Phil at plocey@dconc.gov to inquire.
LOCATION:East Meeting Room\, East Regional Library (211 Lick Creek Lane)
